necap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div><a href="/blog" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">Blog</a><a href="/case-studies" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">Case Studies</a><a href="/resources" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">SBC Knowledge</a><a href="/contact" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">Contact</a><a href="/book-free-audit" class="ml-2 bg-gold px-4 py-2.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint">Book Free Audit</a></nav><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation" class="rounded p-2 text-ink lg:hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></header><div class="bg-ink"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="shell py-3 text-paper/70 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px]"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-paper/40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="">About Us</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-paper/40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="font-medium text-paper" aria-current="page">Our Approach</span></li></ol></nav></div><main><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-paper md:text-[3rem]">Our Approach to Consulting</h1><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-paper/80">We don&#x27;t believe in advice without accountability. Every SBC engagement is built around one commitment — we stay until the job is done.</p></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Not Just Advice. Real Implementation.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Most consulting firms deliver a report and move on. The client is left with recommendations but no implementation support, no accountability and no results.</p><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC operates differently. We embed ourselves in your business or institution — diagnosing the real problems, designing practical solutions, and implementing them alongside your team until measurable outcomes are achieved. This is not project-based consulting. This is a partnership built on accountability, integrity and outcomes.</p></section><div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal border border-ink-tint bg-paper p-5"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">What Others Do</p><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Deliver a report, present recommendations, and move on — leaving implementation and results to the client.</p></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal border border-gold/60 bg-paper p-5"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">What SBC Does</p><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Stay embedded until measurable outcomes are achieved — accountable from diagnosis through implementation.</p></section></div></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-2xl"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Four Ways to Engage With SBC</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-9"><ol class="divide-y divide-ink-tint border-t border-ink-tint"><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">01</span><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Complimentary Business Audit</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">45-minute focused conversation identifying business gaps and leverage points. No commitment required.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">02</span><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Detailed Diagnostic</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">2–4 week comprehensive assessment using GAP360™ methodology across operations, systems, people, process and strategy.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">03</span><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Project Engagement</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">Fixed scope work with defined timelines for feasibility studies, DPRs, institutional setup, market research or strategic roadmaps.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">04</span><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Implementation Partnership</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">Embedded hands-on engagement lasting until measurable results are achieved.</p></li></ol></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><div><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Ongoing Advisory</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Retainership</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Monthly advisory support with review cadences, dashboards and strategic guidance.</p></div><a href="/book-free-audit" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Book Free Audit →</a></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-2xl"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">The SBC Differentiators</h2></section><div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-handshake size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 1 0 3-3"></path><path d="m14 14 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3l-3.88-3.88a3 3 0 0 0-4.24 0l-.88.88a1 1 0 1 1-3-3l2.81-2.81a5.79 5.79 0 0 1 7.06-.87l.47.28a2 2 0 0 0 1.42.25L21 4"></path><path d="m21 3 1 11h-2"></path><path d="M3 3 2 14l6.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3"></path><path d="M3 4h8"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Partnership Not Project</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">We embed ourselves in your business or institution and stay until measurable outcomes are achieved.</p></article></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">On-Ground Presence</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Hands-on, in-person engagement — not remote reports without accountability.</p></article></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14"></path><path d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Research-Backed Decisions</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Every recommendation is grounded in evidence, data and structured methodology.</p></article></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Accountability at Every Step</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">We stand behind our recommendations through to implementation and results.</p></article></section></div></div></section><section id="book" aria-labelledby="cta-heading" class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-gold-wash"><div class="shell"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center"><h2 id="cta-heading" class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.75rem]">Start With a Free 45-Minute Business Audit</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">No commitment. No jargon. Just clarity on where your business stands and what needs to change.</p><a href="/book-free-audit" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-8 py-4 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint">Book Your Free Audit <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section></main><footer class="bg-ink text-paper"><div class="shell grid gap-10 py-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,2.5fr)] lg:gap-10"><div><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3"><img src="/sbc-logo.png" alt="Sagar Burse Consulting SBC logo" width="96" height="96" class="size-[96px] shrink-0 rounded-full"/><span class="truncate font-display text-[17px] font-semibold">Sagar Burse Consulting</span></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-paper/90">A multi-division advisory firm contributing to India&#x27;s MSME ecosystem from Ahmedabad, Gujarat.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-8 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-x-6"><nav aria-label="Quick Links" class="min-w-0"><p class="font-display text-[17px] font-bold text-paper">Quick Links</p><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2"><li class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed break-words"><a href="/" class="text-paper/85 transition-colors hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed break-words"><a href="/about-sbc" class="text-paper/85 transition-colors hover:text-gold">About SBC</a></li><li class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed break-words"><a href="/gap360" class="text-paper/85 transition-colors ho